d/dt (x.p) = -lam*x1^2 - lam*x2^2 - g*m*x3 - lam*x3^2 + p1^2/m + p2^2/m + p3^2/m
lambda = -(g*m^2*x3 - p1^2 - p2^2 - p3^2)/(m*x1^2 + m*x2^2 + m*x3^2)
tension lambda R with |p| = m v, |x| = R: (m*v^2 - g*m*x3)/R
  at the bottom (x3 = -R): g*m + m*v^2/R ;  at rest at the bottom: g*m
max | x3(cartesian) - x3(angles) | over 0 <= t <= 3: True (1.4e-11)
max | |x| - R | along the cartesian orbit: True
